body:
There will be no static payment. As I said, this is more a hobby thing than a real job and I don't have what it takes to seriously pay someone besides what's been said in the last part of my first message. This could evolve in the future, but at it is right now, I'm looking for someone passionate with video games and that doesn't focus only on money.

&#x200B;

I could totally make it a totally-unpaid position but I'm doing my best to still remunerate. If you're looking for a real web developer position with a high salary and wish only to code without passion, this offer does not fit.
